description:
Change

    case DATA_FRAME:
        if (condition) {
            do stuff;
            break;
        }
        do other stuff;
        break;

to

    case DATA_FRAME:
        if (condition) {
            do stuff;
        } else {
            do other stuff;
        }
        break;

to make it clearer that it's "do this if condition is true, else do
that".

